      "id": 14982,
      "name": "MigrantP",
      "username": "MigrantP",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/migrantp/{size}/1921_2.png",
      "created_at": "2016-04-05T17:02:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<div>Wrath of the Cosmos is coming soon! Just like we did with Shattered Timelines, tonight we'll be hosting a little party on our <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/handelabragames\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Twitch channel</a> 1 hour before #SentinelsLive kicks off (Party begins at 6pm Eastern Time).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>You'll get to be the first to hear all the great new music by Jean-Marc and see the amazing new environments created by Jenn! The whole Handelabra Games team will be there to answer your questions.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>There will be at least 1 big surprise before the party is over, so don't miss it! <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/handelabragames\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Follow us now on Twitch</a> to be notified when we go live.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>If you just can't wait till tonight, why not check out the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOGq3_KPd6U\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Shattered Timelines Listening Party</a>, or watch \"<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X6DwnlokPdo\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">The Hero in the Arena</a>\" (aka, the Wrath of the Cosmos Trailer) a few hundred more times?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span>We hope to see you tonight!</span></div>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:47:13.382Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
