      "read": false,
      "user_title": null,
      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "<div>Wrath of the Cosmos is coming soon! Just like we did with Shattered Timelines, tonight we&#39;ll be hosting a little party on our <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/handelabragames\">Twitch channel</a> 1 hour before #SentinelsLive kicks off (Party begins at 6pm Eastern Time).</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>You&#39;ll get to be the first to hear all the great new music by Jean-Marc and see the amazing new environments created by Jenn! The whole Handelabra Games team will be there to answer your questions.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>There will be at least 1 big surprise before the party is over, so don&#39;t miss it! <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/handelabragames\">Follow us now on Twitch</a> to be notified when we go live.</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div>If you just can&#39;t wait till tonight, why not check out the <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OOGq3_KPd6U\">Shattered Timelines Listening Party</a>, or watch &quot;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X6DwnlokPdo\">The Hero in the Arena</a>&quot; (aka, the Wrath of the Cosmos Trailer) a few hundred more times?</div><div>&nbsp;</div><div><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">We hope to see you tonight!</span></div>",
